{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1958"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c164): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c164.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1958"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge literature/modern-lit","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/literature__modern-lit.g3.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",156],["-","books"],["+","novels"],["=",147],["+","The very first sentence warns that something is wrong: \"It was a bright cold day in April, and the clocks were striking thirteen\" – 13 strokes, on clocks that ought to stop at twelve. "],["=",35],["+"," The name on the cover was itself a mask: the author was Eric Arthur Blair, who had adopted his pen name for his first book in 1933. George was as English as a name could be, and for the surname he borrowed a landscape he loved – the River Orwell in Suffolk, the county where his parents lived."],["=",265],["-","anyway."],["+","anyway"],["=",1],["+","– a fireman's job is to burn books, and the houses that hide them. "],["=",381]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",152],["-","Bücher"],["+","Romane"],["=",141],["+","Schon der erste Satz warnt, dass etwas nicht stimmt: „Es war ein klarer, kalter Tag im April, und die Uhren schlugen dreizehn“ – 13 Schläge auf Uhren, die bei zwölf aufhören sollten. "],["=",33],["+"," Schon der Name auf dem Umschlag war eine Maske: Der Autor hieß Eric Arthur Blair und hatte sich sein Pseudonym 1933 für sein erstes Buch zugelegt. George war so englisch, wie ein Vorname nur sein kann, und für den Nachnamen lieh er sich eine Landschaft, die er liebte – Pate stand der Fluss Orwell in Suffolk, der Grafschaft, in der seine Eltern lebten."],["=",265],["-","liest."],["+","liest"],["=",1],["+","– Bücher zu verbrennen, samt den Häusern, die sie verstecken, ist die Aufgabe eines Feuerwehrmanns. "],["=",365]]}]},
